  "query_preview": "/SATURDAY THROUGH WEDNESDAY/...\nIssued at 130 PM MDT Thu Oct 15 2026\n\nWarmer and drier conditions remain in the offing for the weekend into early\nnext week, as upper level ridging builds into the region. Latest model data\ndoes indicate some moisture embedded within said westerly flow bringing\nchances for showers across the higher terrain, especially along and west \nof the ContDvd by Sunday and into Monday. Southwest flow aloft then increases \nthrough the middle of next week, as another system digs into the Great Basin, \nleading to increasing chances of precipitation to areas along and west of the \nContDvd through the middle of of the week. Models continue to differ on the \ntiming and strength of said system lifting out across the Rockies through \nthe end of next week.",
